<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  SUB-PAGE ENTER. The whole entrance vocabulary a sub-screen is allowed
  (00-rules.md 8.9: "A screen appears; it does not perform").

  Reveal: translationX @dimen/space_16 -> 0 and alpha 0 -> 1, together, over
  @integer/motion_subpage_enter 260ms on @interpolator/ease_out_quint. That is the
  32-master-plan-android.md 7.3 choreography row "Sub-page enter" verbatim, and
  it is the only motion permitted when a sub-page opens: no slide from the screen
  edge, no scale, no shared-element choreography, no scrim wipe, no stagger of
  the content behind it.

  Only transform and alpha move (00-rules.md 8.7 forbids animating layout
  properties for effect), so nothing here triggers a measure or a layout pass and
  the entrance costs one composited frame's worth of work.

  Tokens, not literals: 260 is @integer/motion_subpage_enter and 16dp is @dimen/space_16
  from the one spacing scale. Its reverse lives in subpage_exit.xml at
  @integer/motion_subpage_exit 195 = 75% of enter (00-rules.md 3.7, 8.5); the two
  files are a pair and neither is retimed without the other.

  Reduced motion is a contract (00-rules.md 8.8): DO NOT pass this resource
  directly to overridePendingTransition. Go through ui/component/SubPage.kt,
  which checks MotionUtils.animationsEnabled() and substitutes a 0ms no-op so the
  page snaps to its end state. An animation that skips that check is a P1
  accessibility defect.

  API floor on the slide: the platform only learned to read a TYPE_DIMENSION out
  of fromXDelta in API 29 (Animation.Description.parseValue). This app's minSdk
  is 24, so on API 24-28 the delta resolves to 0 and the entrance degrades to the
  260ms fade alone - the correct tempo and curve, one channel short. It degrades,
  it never breaks, and the alternative (a percentage of the view's own width)
  would be an off-scale distance that grows with the screen.
-->
<set xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:duration="@integer/motion_subpage_enter"
    android:fillAfter="false"
    android:interpolator="@interpolator/ease_out_quint"
    android:shareInterpolator="true">

    <translate
        android:fromXDelta="@dimen/space_16"
        android:toXDelta="0" />

    <alpha
        android:fromAlpha="0.0"
        android:toAlpha="1.0" />

</set>
